** HTPAS-ALT-KEY1 = HTPAS-CHARTNO  + HTPAS-KEY
** HTPAS-ALT-KEY2 = HTPAS-PTID     + HTPAS-KEY
** HTPAS-ALT-KEY3 = HTPAS-CMD-DATE + HTPAS-KEY
** HTPAS-ALT-KEY4 = HTPAS-TRN-SW   + HTPAS-CMD-DATE + HTPAS-KEY
** HTPAS-ALT-KEY5 = HTPAS-CHKSURED + HTPAS-KEY
** HTPAS-ALT-KEY6 = HTPAS-PASDATE  + HTPAS-SRC-SW   + HTPAS-CTY-UNIT + HTPAS-KEY

** HTPAS-SRC-SW : 1> 住院, 2> 門診, 3> 快速門診, 4> 社區衛生所

** 登錄作業：
** MOVE 'N' TO HTPAS-TRN-SW.
** MOVE 'C','M','D' TO HTPAS-CMD-SW.

** IF 委檢作業
**      KEYIN HTPAS-SRC-SW, HTPAS-CTY-UNIT, HTPAS-CHK-NO, HTPAS-CHKCODE

** ELSE
**      MOVE HTPAS-CHKNO TO HTPAS-CHK-NO
**      USE  HTPDT-PNO-HSP-CD READ NID-MST MOVE NID-CODE TO HTPAS-CHKCODE.

** 轉出作業：
** MOVE 'Y' TO HTPAS-TRN-SW.
** EVALUATE HTPAS-FUN-TYPE
**     WHEN ' ' OR 'D'
**          IF HTPAS-CMD-SW = 'C' OR 'M'
**               MOVE 'I' TO HTPAS-FUN-TYPE
**          END-IF
**     WHEN 'I' OR 'U'
**          IF HTPAS-CMD-SW = 'D'
**               MOVE 'D' TO HTPAS-FUN-TYPE
**          ELSE
**               MOVE 'U' TO HTPAS-FUN-TYPE
**          END-IF
** END-EVALUATE.
** MOVE DATA OF HT_PPAS.MST TO DATA OF HT_PPAS.SEQ
** WRTITE HTPAS-SEQ-REC
** REWRITE HTPAS-REC

** 轉入作業：
** USE  HTPASQ-CHKNO OF HT_PPAS.SEQ READ HT_PPAS.MST & MOVE DATA OF HT_PPAS.SEQ TO DATA OF HT_PPAS.MST


