                MOVE MET-IPD-NO(1:11)   TO FNS-B1-IP-NO
        END-IF.
        MOVE W-PAT-NO     TO W-FNS-PAT-NO FNS-DATA(23:8).
        MOVE W-FNS-PAT-NO TO FNS-B1-PAT-NO.
*> .............發出通知或回覆的醫師
        MOVE MET-NOT-DR TO FNS-B1-SEND-DR-NO FNS-DATA(31:4).
*> .............接收通知或回覆的科別

        MOVE MET-DPT    TO FNS-B1-RECV-IP-DPT.
