 F-FIND-MET-DATA.
*> 找出醫師之專科科別及歸屬科別

        INITIALIZE NID-MST-REC.
        MOVE "0503"             TO NID-ID.
        MOVE W-RUN-PAR1(1:4)    TO NID-CODE.
        READ NID-MST KEY IS NID-MST-KEY.
        MOVE NID-MST-REC(25:4)  TO W-DR-DPT1.
        MOVE NID-MST-REC(184:4) TO W-DR-DPT2.
        INITIALIZE MET-MST-REC.
