***********************************************************************
*------>NOT
*COPY    "HR_GNOT.PRC".
***********************************************************************
*> C-PY "HR_GNOT.PRC".
***********************************************************************
*>******************************************************************************

*   資料輸出，MOVE SPACE         TO W-UNOTD-TBL
*             MOVE 最大輸入欄位  TO W-MAX-TEX
*             MOVE 最大輸入行數  TO W-MAX-NOT
*             MOVE 資料TBL       TO W-UNOTD-TBL
*             PERFORM F-GNOT-RTN THRU F-GNOT-EXIT
*             ......將  W-GNOTD(EE)  TO   資料
*>******************************************************************************
*> 計算有效資料行數有幾行
 F-GNOT-RTN.
        INITIALIZE W-GG1 W-GG2 W-GG3 W-GG4 W-GGA W-GGB.
        MOVE SPACE      TO W-GNOTD-TBL.
        PERFORM VARYING W-GG FROM W-MAX-NOT BY -1 UNTIL
                W-UNOTD(W-GG) NOT = SPACES OR W-GG = 1
                MOVE W-GG       TO W-GG1
        END-PERFORM.
*
        COMPUTE W-GG1 = W-GG1 - 1.
*
*> (W-GG2 = 有效行數 * 每行BYTE數)計算只要檢查到第幾個BYTE為止
        COMPUTE W-GG2 = W-GG1 * W-MAX-TEX.

*> W-GG3 檢查總BYTE數的變數，一個BYTE一個BYTE檢查
*> (W-GGA:W-GGB)計算位置
*> W-GGC 檢查若無"0D0A",若超過一行編輯時,也要自動換行存一筆
        MOVE 1  TO W-GGA.
        PERFORM VARYING W-GG3 FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL W-GG3 > W-GG2
                PERFORM F-CHK-GNOT-RTN THRU F-CHK-GNOT-EXIT
        END-PERFORM.
 F-GNOT-EXIT.
        EXIT.
*> 若檢查到"0D0A"則切行
 F-CHK-GNOT-RTN.
        IF W-UNOTD-TBL(W-GG3:2) = W-LAT THEN
                MOVE W-GG3      TO W-GGB
                COMPUTE W-GGB = W-GGB - W-GGA
                INITIALIZE W-MNOT
                MOVE W-UNOTD-TBL(W-GGA:W-GGB)   TO W-MNOT
                PERFORM F-MOVE-NOT-RTN THRU F-MOVE-NOT-EXIT
                COMPUTE W-GGA = W-GG3 + 2
                MOVE W-GGA      TO  W-GG3
        ELSE
                COMPUTE W-GGC = W-GG3 - W-GGA
                IF W-GGC = W-MAX-TEX THEN
                        MOVE W-UNOTD-TBL(W-GGA:W-MAX-TEX)       TO W-MNOT
                        PERFORM F-MOVE-NOT-RTN THRU F-MOVE-NOT-EXIT
                        MOVE W-GG2      TO W-GGA
                ELSE
                        INITIALIZE W-GGC
                END-IF
        END-IF.
 F-CHK-GNOT-EXIT.
        EXIT.
*> 搬出正確值
 F-MOVE-NOT-RTN.
        ADD 1           TO W-GG4.
        MOVE W-MNOT     TO W-GNOTD(W-GG4).
 F-MOVE-NOT-EXIT.

        EXIT.
*>******************************************************************************
*   資料搬入，MOVE    1         TO W-GGA
*             MOVE 最大輸入欄位 TO W-MAX-TEX
*             MOVE 最大輸入行數 TO W-MAX-NOT
*             MOVE SPACE        TO W-GNOTD-TBL
*             INITIALIZE W-MNOT
*             MOVE 資料         TO W-MNOT
*             PERFORM F-INOT-RTN THRU F-INOT-EXIT
*             ......資料搬完後 將 W-GNOTD-TBL 搬出
*>******************************************************************************
 F-INOT-RTN.
        INITIALIZE W-GGB W-GGC.
        PERFORM VARYING W-GG FROM W-MAX-TEX BY -1 UNTIL
                W-MNOT(W-GG:1) NOT = SPACES
                MOVE W-GG       TO W-GGB
        END-PERFORM.
*
        COMPUTE W-GGB = W-GGB - 1.
*
        MOVE W-MNOT(1:W-GGB)    TO W-GNOTD-TBL(W-GGA:W-GGB).
        COMPUTE W-GGA = W-GGA + W-GGB.
        MOVE 2          TO W-GGC.
        MOVE W-LAT      TO W-GNOTD-TBL(W-GGA:W-GGC).
        COMPUTE W-GGA = W-GGA + W-GGC.
 F-INOT-EXIT.
        EXIT.
***********************************************************************
*> END OF "HR_GNOT.PRC".
