**********************************
 F-METOIF-RTN.
        INITIALIZE W-MET1IF-LNK.
        MOVE "2"                TO W-MET1IF-SEL-ID.
        MOVE W-JOB              TO W-MET1IF-JOB-ID.
        MOVE "E"                TO W-MET1IF-SYS-ID.
        IF W-JOB = "1" THEN
